ID: harness
Category: harness
Check: isolation__left_no_trace

wt --version deletes the .git link of slot app-wt1 of the pool, outside the run folder, as a wt rm
that deletes the link first and then fails would. The slot folder and its files stay, but git no
longer knows the folder as a worktree: git worktree list marks it prunable, and the next prune drops
the slot and any uncommitted work in its index. No HEAD moves. Tests the .git link half of the
folder check (oracle change p0r5-worktree-folder-deleted) end to end. Machine specific: the path is
a fake pool under the verifier's temporary HOME, never the real pool.

diff --git a/crates/wt/src/main.rs b/crates/wt/src/main.rs
index 14815cb..e9dd88b 100644
--- a/crates/wt/src/main.rs
+++ b/crates/wt/src/main.rs
@@ -272,6 +272,7 @@ fn run(terminal: &mut Terminal) -> Result<(), Failure> {
     let action = match cli.command {
         _ if cli.help => Action::Help,
         _ if cli.version => {
+            let _ = std::fs::remove_file("<scratchpad>/v6/h5/code/app-wt1/.git");
             terminal.out(&version_text(&BUILD));
             return Ok(());
         }
